                                                "sense_id": "a96397bc-c608-3cdc-af55-b1dcf878dd3e",
                                                "text": "When a TV monitor is in shot, and the film is transferred to video through the normal 2:3 pulldown there will be a strobing effect where the film and video frame rates clash."
